          "borderColor": "#3a0ca3",
          "headline": "Retired General Romeo Poquiz Arrested for Sedition",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-01-05&search=Retired%20General%20Romeo%20Poquiz%20Arrested%20for%20Sedition",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Retired Air Force general Romeo Poquiz, convenor of the United People's Initiative, was arrested at NAIA on an inciting-to-sedition warrant after a Facebook post critical of President Marcos. He posted ₱48,000 bail the same day and denied calling for the president's ouster, calling the case harassment of anti-corruption protesters. The arrest is the week's sharpest test of how far the administration will go against retired officers who have joined the street campaign.</p>",
          "sourceLinks": [
