          "categoryClass": "economic",
          "borderColor": "#0b6e4f",
          "headline": "Marcos Signs P6.793 Trillion Budget with Anti-Corruption Veto",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-01-05&search=Marcos%20Signs%20P6.793%20Trillion%20Budget%20with%20Anti-Corruption%20Veto",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>President Marcos signed the ₱6.793-trillion 2026 General Appropriations Act and vetoed ₱92.5 billion in Unprogrammed Appropriations, closing a release channel that critics tied to the flood-control scandal. The budget carries no new locally funded flood-control projects. The veto is the first appropriations act of the year to treat unprogrammed funds as a graft risk rather than a reserve.</p>",
          "sourceLinks": [
            {
              "label": "bloomberg.com",
              "href": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-01-05/philippines-marcos-slashes-backdoor-for-graft-in-2026-budget-after-scandal"
