          "borderColor": "#c77d10",
          "headline": "Mayon Volcano Alert Level Raised to 3 - Magmatic Eruption Underway",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-01-06&search=Mayon%20Volcano%20Alert%20Level%20Raised%20to%203%20-%20Magmatic%20Eruption%20Underway",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>PHIVOLCS raised Mayon to Alert Level 3 less than a week after Level 2, confirming slow extrusion of degassed magma and a summit lava dome. The agency warned of lava flows, pyroclastic density currents, and possible explosive activity within days or weeks, and recorded 364 rockfalls since New Year's Day. Residents were told to stay out of the 6-kilometer permanent danger zone.</p>",
          "sourceLinks": [
            {
              "label": "rappler.com",
