          "categoryClass": "natural-disasters",
          "borderColor": "#c77d10",
          "headline": "Binaliw Landfill Collapse Kills 28 in Cebu City - State of Calamity Declared",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-01-08&search=Binaliw%20Landfill%20Collapse%20Kills%2028%20in%20Cebu%20City%20-%20State%20of%20Calamity%20Declared",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>A roughly 35-meter garbage slope collapsed at 4:17 p.m. onto Cebu City's Binaliw sanitary landfill, burying sanitation workers at the materials-recovery facility. Early counts put fatalities in the high 20s before the final toll later reached 36; DENR issued a cease-and-desist order on operator Prime Integrated Waste Solutions. The collapse shut Metro Cebu's main dump and opened a workplace-safety investigation under RA 9003.</p>",
